# Almost nothing here is generated: `site/` is finished HTML, CSS and SVG, and the
# deploy job uploads the directory as it stands. The exception is `site/demo/`,
# which is generated and committed on purpose — it is the dashboard out of the
# program's repository, and the point of committing it is that a reader gets the
# real interface. It is written by `make demo` over there, so it is deliberately
# not listed below.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor and tooling leftovers
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# If a local preview tool ever writes into the tree, or somebody scripts a check
# with npm, this keeps it out of the repository.
node_modules/
build/
dist/
